### 1. Login to get your token (Copy the token from the response)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@ankap.com",
  "password": "mysecretpassword"
}

### 2. Create a Product (Replace YOUR_TOKEN_HERE with the copied token)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJhbmthcC1tYXJrZXRwbGFjZSIsInN1YiI6InRlc3RAYW5rYXAuY29tIiwicm9sZXMiOlsiQlVZRVIiXSwiaWF0IjoxNzczMTY5MzcyLCJleHAiOjE3NzMxNzAyNzJ9.l4LgmO44Je3Uas69Qt2hnqf8Z_Zk4_kTmZEBNDtkc-k
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mechanical Keyboard",
  "description": "Blue switches, RGB",
  "price": 129.99,
  "stockQuantity": 50
}

### 3. Verify Public Access (This should work WITHOUT a token)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products


### Test Order Service Routing
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/test

### 3. Place the Order (Replace YOUR_TOKEN_HERE and ensure productId exists)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJhbmthcC1tYXJrZXRwbGFjZSIsInN1YiI6InRlc3RAYW5rYXAuY29tIiwicm9sZXMiOlsiQlVZRVIiXSwiaWF0IjoxNzczMTcwNjgyLCJleHAiOjE3NzMxNzE1ODJ9.70dINPEDlhkh-bVvbgfeHCV8inSNW8fyni6Ngvf0OUg
